@yyx990803 @sodatea 
There is actually a reproduction for it [here](https://github.com/nuxt/nuxt/issues/23981#issuecomment-1788481043). Although it's quite complex, based on the debugging results, the `vnode.el` rendered on the client side is **indeed a comment node**. However, it has also been fixed by https://github.com/vuejs/core/commit/dd8a0cf5dcde13d2cbd899262a0e07f16e14e489. While working on my fix, I discovered that the actual `<!--[-->` node can be hydrated. But it doesn't seem to be that important(really an edge case). I have closed my PR.
